{"title": "Components/Table/Table Row Cell", "docs": {"text": "Table Row Cell\nAccessible AA\nLabel\nShow code\nCopy code\n\nName\tDescription\tDefault\tControl\ntype\t\nthe Type of the Cell.\n\"label\"\n\"link\"\n\"menu\"\n\"progress\"\n\"slot\"\n\"action\"\n\"tags\"\n\"label\"\ntype\nlabel\t\nthe Label of the Cell. This property is used only when the type is label, otherwise it is ignored.\nstring\nnumber\n-\t\nEdit label as JSON\nspacer\t\nspacer controls the visibility of the content. If spacer is true, all of the other properties are ignored and the content is not showing. This is used for cells that are empty.\n\nboolean\nfalse\nFalseTrue\nalignment\t\ncontrols the alignment of the content of the Cell.\n\"left\"\n\"right\"\n\"left\"\nalignment\n\nleft\n\nright\ntagsProps\t\nit is an array of Tags properties. This property is used only when the type is tags, otherwise it is ignored.\nODSTableRowCellTagProps[]\n-\t\n\ntagsProps :[\n0 :{...} 1 key\n1 :{...} 1 key\n]\nprogressBarProps\t\nthe Progress Bar properties of the Cell. This property is used only when the type is progress, otherwise it is ignored.\nODSProgressBarProps\n-\t\n\nprogressBarProps :{\nlabelText : \"Progress B\"\nsize : \"small\"\nprogress : 40\n}\nactionProps\t\nthe Action Button properties of the Cell. This property is used only when the type is action, otherwise it is ignored.\nODSButtonProps\n-\t\n\nactionProps :{\nbuttonIcon :{...} 5 keys\nbuttonType : \"iconOnly\"\nsize : \"small\"\nvariant : \"ghost\"\n}\nlinkProps\t\nthe Link properties of the Cell. This property is used only when the type is link, otherwise it is ignored.\nODSLinkProps\n-\t\n\nlinkProps :{\nlabel : \"Link A\"\naria-label : \"Link A\"\n}\ntableMultipleActionsFlyoutProps\t\nthe Multiple ActionsFlyout Menu properties of the Cell. This property is used only when the type is menu, otherwise it is ignored.\nODSTableMultipleActionsFlyoutProps\n-\tSet object\nlistData\t\nthe properties of the list of buttons to be displayed in the Multiple ActionsFlyout Menu. This property is used only when the type is menu, otherwise it is ignored.\nODSButtonProps[]\n-\t\n\nlistData :[\n0 :{...} 3 keys\n1 :{...} 3 keys\n]\ncontentSlot\t\nDynamic content of the cell. This property is used only when the type is slot, otherwise it is ignored.\nReactNode | ReactNode[]\n-\t\n\ncontentSlot :{\n$$typeof : Symbol(react.transitional.element)\ntype : \"div\"\nkey : null\nref : null\nprops :{...} 1 key\n}\nelementType\t\nThe html element type. if not provided, the td will be selected.\n\"td\"\n\"th\"\n\"td\"\nelementType\n\ntd\n\nth\ndata-content\t\ncontains the value of the cell that will be compared for the rows sorting. Cells with the type label, progress or link will auto generate that value. If the value is provided, it will be overridden. For the rest of the types and for the sorting to work properly, this property is mandatory.\n\nstring\nnumber\n-\t\nEdit data-content as JSON\nIn a Table\n\nText\nNumber\nTags\nLink\nProgress\nActions\nB Text\n2\nTag A\nTag B\nLink B\nProgress B\n\nA Text\n1\nTag A\nLink A\nProgress A\n\nC Text Slot\n3\nTag A\nTag B\nTag C\nTag D\nLink C\nProgress C\n\nShow code\nCopy code\n", "code": [""], "stories": [{"id": "story--components-tablerowcell--example", "html": "<div id=\"story--components-tablerowcell--example-inner\" data-name=\"Example\" lang=\"en\"><div><tbody class=\"ODSTableBody\"><tr class=\"ODSTableRow\"><td role=\"cell\" class=\"ODSTableRowCell ODSTableRowCell--type-label ODSTableRowCell--alignment-left\" data-content=\"Label\"><div class=\"ODSRow ODSTableRowCell-Wrapper\"><span class=\"ODSTableRowCell-Label\">Label</span></div></td></tr></tbody></div></div>"}, {"id": "story--components-tablerowcell--in-table", "html": "<div id=\"story--components-tablerowcell--in-table-inner\" data-name=\"In Table\" lang=\"en\"><div><div class=\"ODSTable-Wrapper\"><table class=\"ODSTable\" role=\"table\"><thead role=\"rowgroup\" class=\"ODSTableHead\"><tr class=\"ODSTableHeadRow\" ro